","clipName":"Name","clipTrigger":"When?","clipRow":"Start row","clipFrames":"Frames","clipFps":"Speed (fps)","clipLoop":"Loop","clipRowsUsed":"Rows {from}–{to}","trigger_MOVING":"While walking","trigger_IDLE":"Standing still","trigger_SIT":"Sitting","trigger_SLEEP":"Sleeping","trigger_EAT":"When fed","trigger_RANDOM":"Random fidget","guideTitle":"How to build the spritesheet","guideBody":"• One PNG. Each ROW is a direction, each COLUMN a frame.\n• Row order (fixed for all): 0=South, 1=North, 2=SE, 3=NW, 4=East, 5=West, 6=NE, 7=SW.\n• Every animation uses the same 8 rows; they differ by START COLUMN. e.g. if each row is [idle, w1..w8]: idle → col 0, 1 frame; walk → col 1, 8 frames.\n• \"Cell width/height\" = the size of ONE frame (68×68 for your cats).\n• With fewer than 8 directions only the first rows of that list are used.\nThe first frame of sit/sleep is the standing pose and the last is settled, so on those clips untick “Loop”: they play the transition once and freeze on the last frame.","clipStartCol":"Start col.","clipOwnImage":"Own image","clipOwnImageHint":"Optional. If this animation lives in a separate PNG (e.g. sleep on its own), upload it here. Otherwise it uses the main image.","petsPrice":"Price (coins)","petsPriceHint":"Cost to adopt it in the game shop. 0 = not for sale.","petsShopVisible":"Visible in shop","petsNotForSale":"Not for sale","clipLoopHint":"No loop = plays once and holds the last frame (sit, sleep, eat).","lessonContent":{"title":"Lesson content","blockCount":"{count} block(s)","edit":"Edit","preview":"Preview","previewAsStudent":"Preview as student","empty":"No blocks yet. Use \"Add content\" to get started.","addBlock":"Add content","drag":"Drag to reorder","moveUp":"Move up","moveDown":"Move down","duplicate":"Duplicate","collapse":"Collapse","delete":"Delete","block":{"text":"Text","heading":"Heading","code":"Code","callout":"Callout","note":"Note","quote":"Quote","image":"Image","list":"List","divider":"Divider"},"field":{"level":